{"duration_api_ms":8547,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9802e1a3-4bee-4828-a01e-8aea4fc0f9b5","total_cost_usd":0.0010294,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1393,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1040},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1393,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":744,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":744},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1286,"outputTokens":1504,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":744,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0010294,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1129,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":744,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Seed vs. expenditure:** Seed capital is sponsor cash invested in fund shares. It is a balance-sheet asset, recovered on redemption, and carries market risk. It is not an expense. Expenditure is cash spent and not recovered.\n\n**One-time (sponsor-paid):** registration and legal, index license setup, platform onboarding, listing, launch marketing.\n\n**Recurring (paid from the unitary fee, sponsor-funded above the cap):** fund administration, custody, transfer agent, audit, compliance, trustee fees, index royalties, market-maker incentives, regulatory filings, platform fees.\n\n**Outside the fee (investor-borne):** trading spreads, taxes, extraordinary litigation.\n\n**Break-even:** Let f be the unitary fee, v the variable cost rate, and F the fixed annual cost. Then break-even AUM = F / (f − v), which requires f > v. For a target retained margin M, AUM = (F + M) / (f − v). Seed carrying cost is an opportunity cost, modeled separately.","ttft_ms":6187,"type":"result","duration_ms":7496,"uuid":"6a9debd8-737d-4d49-9305-ebee6324e205","ttft_stream_ms":407,"time_to_request_ms":49,"first_content_frame_ms":407,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
